 stone, hand your friend a touch controller and get them to \"SWEEP!\".\n\nCurling is fundamentally a social game. So is this VR game! The social aspect is similar to \"Keep Talking & Nobody Explodes\". Everyone needs to be in the same room. Sweepers for your team don't use the HMD, they use only the Touch controllers. Opposing teams play hot-seat style. Handing off a single Quest HMD to a member on the other team.\n\nComputer controlled AI curlers are not yet implemented.\n\nDemo is also available! https://www.oculus.com/experiences/quest/4387676764681800/", "short_description": "Play the sport of curling. A Winter Olympics party game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bouncylasers.com/curlingprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Shawn Featherly", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.bouncylasers.com/curling", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "7938729246164091"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974798_417501693258994_6557272125450107768_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zmH3qWdE9pEQ7kNvwHs50DR&_nc_oc=AdqFSC3S34iqmFJyND9R7RRIjjXbZP40NpKxLvbYA6FhZBGuNDs9G2Yn7PZbsKmnT0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_n